<title>USA: First Alert closes $80 mln credit pact.</title>
<headline>First Alert closes $80 mln credit pact.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Ill. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Alert Inc said Wednesday it completed an $80 million senior secured revolving credit agreement with NationsBank N.A. replacing the company's existing $70 million credit facility.</p>
<p>The new agreement provides flexibility to fund existing working capital requirements and a strong base for future growth, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>First Alert makes and markets residential safety products including smoke and carbon monoxide detectors.</p>
<p>		    ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
